# a disjunction of structs at the top of a schema, reduced to one of them
-- old.cue --
{a: int} | {b: int}
-- new.cue --
{a: int}
-- out --
incompatible
the top level accepts any field name in the prior schema and is closed in the new one (rule labels-narrowed) @ old.cue:1:1
the top level accepts any field name in the prior schema and is closed in the new one (rule labels-narrowed) @ old.cue:1:12
a is required in the new schema but not declared in the prior one (rule field-added-required) @ new.cue:1:2
b is declared in the prior schema and not accepted by the new one (rule field-removed) @ old.cue:1:13
